A.dVH=s(["Just as I was about to leave the house, the phone rang.","I didn't know anything yet at that time."],t.s)
A.e81=s(["In those days, I worked late every day.","When I was a student, there were no mobile phones yet."],t.s)
A.eJQ=s(["I'll be away for a week, so please look after the cat during that time.","I took medicine and slept, and my fever went down in the meantime."],t.s)
A.cUL=s(["I played until late at night and was sleepy the next day.","The day after I moved, I went to greet the neighbors."],t.s)
A.fri=s(["I will contact you again in a few days.","A few days after coming back from the trip, I ran a fever."],t.s)
A.fA1=s(["The other day, I ran into an old friend at the station.","I'm going to return the book I borrowed the other day."],t.s)
A.dY8=s(["Last Sunday, I stayed home all day.","The dish my mother made for me the other day was delicious."],t.s)
A.c_z=s(["For now, I have no plans to travel.","So far, I'm feeling fine."],t.s)
A.dFw=s(["The fun time passed in no time.","The summer vacation was over in the blink of an eye."],t.s)
A.dVW=s(["It suddenly began to rain in the early afternoon.","A friend came over to my house in the early afternoon."],t.s)
A.cN9=s(["My leg has been aching a little since a few weeks ago.","The trip is only a few weeks away, so I'm looking forward to it."],t.s)
A.d9g=s(["I started a new job several months ago.","Several months have passed since I moved."],t.s)
A.eNo=s(["I take a walk in the nearby park almost every day.","It's been raining almost every day lately."],t.s)
A.dSP=s(["I've been running every morning for a month.","I'm going back to my parents' home for a month starting next month."],t.s)
A.eiP=s(["When I woke up the next morning, snow had piled up.","I get a headache the morning after a drinking party."],t.s)
A.ekZ=s(["I want to live in a warm country all year round.","This shop is busy with customers all year round."],t.s)
A.dCX=s(["I plan to take part in next week's dinner party.","I will send my reply about joining by the end of today."],t.s)
A.cul=s(["Looking at my schedule, next week is busy all week.","I also write my family's plans on the schedule."],t.s)
A.drZ=s(["I had a late breakfast today.","Tomorrow is a day off, so I plan to get up a bit late."],t.s)
A.cZN=s(["The bus came a few minutes late.","I want to get some fresh air, even if only for a few minutes."],t.s)
A.ctt=s(["I hurried to prepare and got ready in time for the presentation.","To meet tomorrow's deadline, I will write my report tonight."],t.s)
A.e_x=s(["I talked on the phone with a friend for hours.","I waited for hours, but the bus did not come."],t.s)
A.e7T=s(["I already have plans for next Saturday.","Plans came up suddenly, so I turned down my friend's invitation."],t.s)
A.dsx=s(["I stayed at a friend's house for just one night.","After a good night's sleep, I felt better."],t.s)
A.cNO=s(["After the new year begins, my family and I go on our first shrine visit of the year.","My new job starts at the beginning of the new year."],t.s)
A.dHn=s(["I spent Sunday relaxing with my family.","I like spending my days off at the park."],t.s)
A.d10=s(["I was talking with a friend until the early morning.","It was cold in the early morning, but it got warm by noon."],t.s)
A.ei5=s(["The long bus ride tired me out.","I sat for a long time, so my legs hurt."],t.s)
A.dig=s(["That day is not convenient, so please make it another day.","Something came up, so I asked to change the appointment."],t.s)
A.dEJ=s(["I write my daily plans in my planner.","Busy days have kept going, and I'm a little tired."],t.s)
A.dx5=s(["I'm going to see a movie with a friend this weekend.","I hear the weather this weekend isn't very good."],t.s)
